OL,3,GNEWSAPublic to have its say on country
OL,4,Apark's future
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning is under way to help shape and
OL,7,Fsustain the future of a popular country
OL,8,Fpark, with the public invited to have
OL,9,Ftheir say.
OL,11,FMount Edgcumbe Country Park, which
OL,12,Foverlooks Plymouth Sound from the Rame
OL,13,FPeninsula, in Cornwall, attracts more
OL,14,Fthan 250,000 visitors each year.
OL,16,FA #65,000 grant from The National
OL,17,FLottery Heritage Fund will now fund a
OL,18,Fconservation management and business
OL,19,Fplan for the estate, setting out how it
OL,20,Fcan be conserved, restored and managed
OL,21,Fover the next 10 years.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
